(Develop a C++ program to represent an electric vehicle charging network using a graph, where charging stations are
represented as vertices and connections between stations are represented as edges.)
(The program should accept a user-defined starting vertex and perform the following modifications in a single program:)

1)Modification A: Accept a different starting vertex and display the DFS traversal order.
2)Modification B: Display all vertices reachable from the starting vertex and identify unvisited or unreachable vertices.
3)Modification C: Count the reachable vertices and display their BFS levels, indicating the minimum number of connections 
required to reach each station from the starting station.
